    {
        "content": "<p>I think so, but could you generalize first? Perhaps to any <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderEmbedding#doc\">docs#OrderEmbedding</a> with an <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrdConnected#doc\">docs#OrdConnected</a> range? Or a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=LeftOrdContinuous#doc\">docs#LeftOrdContinuous</a> function?<br>\nIt'd be great if it could also generalize <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=WithTop.coe_sSup%27#doc\">docs#WithTop.coe_sSup'</a> / <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=WithBot.coe_sSup%27#doc\">docs#WithBot.coe_sSup'</a></p>",
        "id": 626669216,
